msgid "Experimental CPU overclocking can cause a crash or data loss. Stability on this device is not verified. Apply for this session only?"
msgstr "实验性 CPU 超频可能导致死机或数据丢失，尚未验证本机稳定性。是否仅在本次运行中应用？"

msgid "Experimental: direct CPU PLL programming, not NPU overclocking. Not applied at boot; reboot to restore normal settings."
msgstr "实验功能：直接调整 CPU PLL，并非 NPU 超频。不随开机启用，重启可恢复常规设置。"

